%N A401998 Binary codes of free quasi-polyominoes.
%C A401998 In contrast to polyominoes, a quasi-polyomino need not be connected.
%C A401998 The binary code is defined in the same way as for polyominoes in A165197 and A246521.
%C A401998 It is not possible to order the quasi-polyominoes by size (as is done for the polyominoes in A246521), since there are infinitely many of a given size greater than 1.
